/-! ## LT46 (replay budget): the placement maps in closed form

`Baselines.layout.core.poolWire i` is `(List.range' 4115 5699).getD i 0`: the kernel walks the
pool list for every placed wire (≈ 30–40 ms per wire through `kernelPlace`).  Since the pool is
arithmetic (`StairHoleSupport.poolWire_eq`), every layer of the placement is a literal exchange
